{
  "html": "<div class=\"qt-help-welcome-card\"><div class=\"qt-help-welcome-title\">Welcome to Quilltap</div><p class=\"qt-help-welcome-text\">Ah, a fresh arrival! Splendid. Whether you&#x27;ve come to craft characters of uncommon depth or simply to see what all the fuss is about, these guides shall serve as your faithful valet through the proceedings.</p><div class=\"qt-help-welcome-links\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qt-help-welcome-link\"><span data-icon=\"chevron-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"qt-icon w-3.5 h-3.5 flex-shrink-0\"></span>Getting Started with Quilltap</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qt-help-welcome-link\"><span data-icon=\"chevron-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"qt-icon w-3.5 h-3.5 flex-shrink-0\"></span>AI Stack Setup Wizard</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qt-help-welcome-link\"><span data-icon=\"chevron-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"qt-icon w-3.5 h-3.5 flex-shrink-0\"></span>Creating Characters</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qt-help-welcome-link\"><span data-icon=\"chevron-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"qt-icon w-3.5 h-3.5 flex-shrink-0\"></span>Chats Overview</button></div><p class=\"qt-help-welcome-footer\">Or browse the topics below, or switch to the <strong>Ask</strong> tab to chat with a help character.</p></div>"
